OL,3,CTeenager cycling from Wales to
OL,4,CThailand in hospital after bike crash
OL,6,FA teenager from Wales is receiving
OL,7,Fhospital treatment following a bike
OL,8,Faccident in China.
OL,10,FDyfan Hughes, 18, alongside James
OL,11,FThomas, 19, and Louis Dennis, 19, all
OL,12,Ffrom Llangollen, are currently on a
OL,13,F6,000-mile cycling expedition from
OL,14,FNorth Wales to Thailand.
OL,16,FThey are raising money for the British
OL,17,FHeart Foundation and have been
OL,18,Fdocumenting their journey on social
OL,19,Fmedia.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/3
