OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1786274294
OL,3,CTeenager cycling from Wales to
OL,4,CThailand in hospital after bike crash
OL,6,FThe group posted on social media
OL,7,Fsaying that one of the team members,
OL,8,FDyfan, had been involved in an
OL,9,Faccident in China, suffering head,
OL,10,Fneck and leg injuries.
OL,12,FThey said that he is in a stable
OL,13,Fcondition in a Chinese hospital.
OL,15,FThe post on Instagram added: "We don't
OL,16,Fknow what this means for the trip
OL,17,Fright now but one thing is for sure,
OL,18,Fwe will stick together and when we
OL,19,Farrive in Chang Mai, Thailand it will
OL,20,Fbe the 3 of us no matter how long it
OL,21,Ftakes.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/3
