OL,3,CTeenager cycling from Wales to
OL,4,CThailand in hospital after bike crash
OL,6,F"We will give more updates in the next
OL,7,Ffew days."
OL,9,FITV Wales spoke to the trio in June,
OL,10,Fwhen one member of the team suffered a
OL,11,Ffall off his bike. The friends talked
OL,12,Fabout the community support and
OL,13,Fkindness they have received throughout
OL,14,Ftheir journey.
